### Product Service Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8082

### ==========================================
### Test 1: Create a product (should return 201)
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8082/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "sku": "LAPTOP-001",
  "manufacturer": "Dell Technologies",
  "category_id": 1,
  "weight": 2500,
  "some_other_id": 100
}

### ==========================================
### Test 2: Get product by ID (replace {id} with ID from Test 1)
### ==========================================
GET http://localhost:8082/products/1

### ==========================================
### Test 3: Get non-existent product (should return 404)
### ==========================================
GET http://localhost:8082/products/999

### ==========================================
### Test 4: Create another product
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8082/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 999,
  "sku": "MOUSE-001",
  "manufacturer": "Logitech",
  "category_id": 2,
  "weight": 120,
  "some_other_id": 200
}

### ==========================================
### Test 5: Enable bad mode (10% of requests will fail with 503)
### ==========================================
GET http://localhost:8082/products/bad-mode?enabled=true

### ==========================================
### Test 6: Create product with bad mode enabled
### Run this 10 times - ~1 should fail with 503
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8082/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "sku": "KEYBOARD-001",
  "manufacturer": "Corsair",
  "category_id": 2,
  "weight": 950,
  "some_other_id": 300
}

### ==========================================
### Test 7: Disable bad mode
### ==========================================
GET http://localhost:8082/products/bad-mode?enabled=false

### ==========================================
### Test 8: Create product with all required fields
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8082/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "sku": "MONITOR-001",
  "manufacturer": "Samsung",
  "category_id": 3,
  "weight": 5500,
  "some_other_id": 400
}

### ==========================================
### Test 9: Access H2 Console (in browser)
### ==========================================
# http://localhost:8082/h2-console
# JDBC URL: jdbc:h2:mem:productdb
# Username: sa
# Password: (leave empty)